      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900">3. Limited License & Intellectual Property</h2>
        <p class="text-slate-700">
          All original textual explanations, editorial synthesis, structure, and presentation published on PrivacyLawForAll.free are the proprietary intellectual property of the platform creator, protected under international copyright conventions and database protection laws.
        </p>
