        <p class="text-slate-700">
          PrivacyLawForAll.free is operated as an independent, single-creator open educational resource. To keep all guides 100% free without charging reader subscriptions or creating paywalls, we display standard programmatic advertisements (via Google AdSense). Users agree not to engage in fraudulent click generation, automated ad manipulation, or malicious interference with legitimate sponsored placements.
